erson":"luxun-p0044","role":"被流徙","evidence":["luxun-e-o054b-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0045","role":"被流徙","evidence":["luxun-e-o054b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"陆议屡疏求论嫡庶时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-o054b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-o054b-q","source_order":[58,249,"O054b"],"order":10364}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0044","name":"顾承","evidence":["luxun-q-o054","zhanggu-q-d95ac6b70220ae016119","zhanggu-q-2113b80d6f9f8a3da0c7","zhanggu-q-63ddbfc995e047f915c9","zhanggu-q-b221cf26238f4ffc3cb1","zhanggu-q-d8d548abae9ff752f208","zhanggu-q-e98cc63703819ee97cf1","zhanggu-q-ea5533b81634b09aad56","yululu-q-47559182311533bc5244"],"facts":[{"id":"zhanggu-f-63d9881de28e7e0bc0f6","text":"字子直。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-ea5533b81634b09aad56"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"luxun-m-o054-luxun-p0044","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o054"]},{"id":"zhanggu-m-cc4a75e6f3e3e58ca7a0","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及顾承","evidence":["zhanggu-q-55d57ae922cf7f838007","zhanggu-q-3daa3c56b9872fdc7a53","zhanggu-q-d0dbbb7f5888a03c83db"]},{"id":"yululu-m-fbcfb6cb4f650be3840c","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及顾承，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-47559182311533bc5244"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-2554659cfd2fbba6bd23","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-f3afcdb8c325c1801064","layer":"original","quote":"吴大将全琮帅数万众来侵寇〖21〗；时州兵休使〖22〗，在者无几。礼躬勒卫兵御之，战于芍陂〖23〗；自旦及暮，将士死伤过半。礼犯蹈白刃，马被数创，手秉枹鼓〖24〗，奋不顾身；贼众乃退。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":133},{"id":"luxun-e-o054b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-03ef9029e4f75daea2ea","layer":"original","quote":"而逊外生顾谭、顾承、姚信〖23〗，并以亲附太子，枉见流徙〖24〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":28,"end":61},{"id":"luxun-q-o054","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-03ef9029e4f75daea2ea","layer":"original","quote":"书三四上，及求诣都，欲口论嫡庶之分，以匡得失。既不听许，而逊外生顾谭、顾承、姚信〖23〗，并以亲附太子，枉见流徙〖24〗。太子太傅吾粲，坐数与逊交书，下狱死。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79},{"id":"shaodi-e-o013a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0cd1e6082bde64409582","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，吴将朱然等围襄阳之樊城，太傅司马宣王率众拒之。﹝一﹞六月，辛丑〖5〗，退。己卯〖6〗，以征东将军王凌为车骑将军〖7〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：正始二年（公元 241）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bf9ccbeb544f540e6afb","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o012","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33e60ac0c003858f0640","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，帝初通《论语》〖2〗。使太常以太牢祭孔子于辟雍〖3〗，以颜渊配〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"wgc-q0005","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-280a1e8d1f852b5e78af","layer":"original","quote":"二年〖1〗，吴大将全琮数万众寇芍陂〖2〗。凌率诸军逆讨，与贼争塘，力战连日，贼退走。进封南乡侯，邑千三百五十户；迁车骑将军，仪同三司。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"wgc-q0159","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-280a1e8d1f852b5e78af","layer":"original","quote":"吴大将全琮数万众寇芍陂〖2〗。凌率诸军逆讨，与贼争塘，力战连日，贼退走","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":6,"end":41},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o133b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8af6f7908a818f7cd9b1","layer":"original","quote":"琮与魏将王凌，战于芍陂；中郎将秦晃等十余人，战死。车骑将军朱然围樊，大将军诸葛瑾取柤中〖15〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":56,"end":104},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o132","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-339340f557e9065aedfa","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖10〗，大雪，平地深三尺，鸟兽死者太半。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"yululu-q-47559182311533bc5244","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-355aed84b0ccde737459","layer":"pei","quote":"《文士传》曰：“温姊妹三人，皆有节行，为温事，已嫁者皆见录夺。其中妹先适顾承，官以许嫁丁氏。成婚有日，遂饮药而死。吴朝嘉叹，乡人图画，为之赞颂云。”","attribution":"裴注·文士传","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":304,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-38557237fd615b1b7733","start":0,"end":74},{"id":"zhanggu-q-2113b80d6f9f8a3da0c7","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-027aa53bd5dbba95ebf6","layer":"original","quote":"时长公主婿卫将军全琮子寄，为霸宾客〖19〗；寄素倾邪〖20〗，谭所不纳。先是，谭弟承与张休俱北征寿春，全琮时为大都督；与魏将王凌战于芍陂，军不利，魏兵乘胜陷没五营将秦（儿）〔晃〕军；休、承奋击之，遂驻魏师〖21〗。时琮群子绪、端，亦并为将，因敌既驻，乃进击之：凌军用退","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134},{"id":"zhanggu-q-3daa3c56b9872fdc7a53","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-60fc7c60c8160373a740","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：张昭受遗辅佐，功勋克举；忠謇方直，动不为己。而以严见惮〖1〗，以高见外；既不处宰相，又不登师保〖2〗；从容闾巷〖3〗，养老而已：以此明权之不及策也！顾雍依仗素业〖4〗，而将之智局〖5〗：故能究极荣位。诸葛瑾、步骘，并以德度规检，见器当世〖6〗；张承、顾邵，虚心长者，好尚人物；周昭之论，称之甚美：故详录焉。谭献纳在公，有忠贞之节；休、承修志，咸庶为善；爱恶相攻〖7〗，流播南裔〖8〗：哀哉！","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":519,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":198},{"id":"zhanggu-q-55d57ae922cf7f838007","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-c195e655860b7fd17bee","layer":"original","quote":"在郡五年，卒官","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7},{"id":"zhanggu-q-63ddbfc995e047f915c9","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-7f950549b530aaabeac4","layer":"original","quote":"承字子直。嘉禾中，与舅陆瑁俱以礼征〖26〗。权赐丞相雍书曰：“贵孙子直，令问休休〖27〗；至与相见，过于所闻：为君嘉之。”拜骑都尉，领羽林兵","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70},{"id":"zhanggu-q-b221cf26238f4ffc3cb1","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-7f950549b530aaabeac4","layer":"original","quote":"后为吴郡西部都尉〖28〗。与诸葛恪等共平山越，别得精兵八千人。还，屯军章阬〖29〗，拜昭义中郎将。入为侍中。芍陂之役，拜奋威将军，出领京下督","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":71,"end":141},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d0dbbb7f5888a03c83db","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-6eb0af4c477f92dd3257","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《吴录》曰：“全琮父子屡言：‘芍陂之役，为典军陈恂诈增张休、顾承之功，而休、承与恂通情。’休坐系狱；权为谭故，沉吟不决，欲令谭谢而释之。及大会，以问谭；谭不谢，而曰：‘陛下，谗言其兴乎？’”","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":234,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0e9e6cb7871c9e632d55","start":0,"end":98},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d8d548abae9ff752f208","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-27c78b18246ae3b6bd51","layer":"original","quote":"数年，与兄谭、张休等，俱徙交州。年三十七卒","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d95ac6b70220ae016119","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-0ccf265f45e5a3e57842","layer":"original","quote":"为鲁王霸友党所谮，与顾谭、承俱以“芍陂论功事〖19〗，休、承与典军陈恂通情，诈增其伐〖20〗”，并徙交州","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52},{"id":"zhanggu-q-e98cc63703819ee97cf1","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-ef98b9d83cfff8092fa7","layer":"pei","quote":"融字叔长。生于宠贵，少而骄乐。学为章句，博而不精。性宽容，多技艺。数以巾褐奉朝请。后拜骑都尉。赤乌中，诸郡出部伍。新都都尉陈表、吴郡都尉顾承，各率所领人，会佃毗陵，男女各数万口。表病死，权以融代表。后代父瑾领摄","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":335,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b40cbb929728fe480dd3","start":10,"end":115},{"id":"zhanggu-q-ea5533b81634b09aad56","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-7f950549b530aaabeac4","layer":"original","quote":"承字子直。嘉禾中，与舅陆瑁俱以礼征〖26〗。权赐丞相雍书曰：“贵孙子直，令问休休〖27〗；至与相见，过于所闻：为君嘉之。”拜骑都尉，领羽林兵。后为吴郡西部都尉〖28〗。与诸葛恪等共平山越，别得精兵八千人。还，屯军章阬〖29〗，拜昭义中郎将。入为侍中。芍陂之役，拜奋威将军，出领京下督。","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":142}],"profiles":{"luxun-p0044":{"fields":[{"id":"luxun-p0044-directory-courtesy","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"子直","evidence":["zhanggu-q-63ddbfc995e047f915c9"]}],"directory":{"faction":"wu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
